### Code Snippets

```
/* unvisited link */
a:link {
color: #FF0000;
}
/* visited 
link */
a:visited {
color: #00FF00;
}
/* mouse over link */
a:hover {
color: #FF00FF;
}
/* selected link */
a:active {
color: #0000FF;
}

---

div:hover {
background-color: blue;
}

---

input:focus {
background-color: yellow;
}

---

a.highlight:hover {
color: #ff0000;
}

---

p {
display: none;
background-color: yellow;
padding: 20px;
}
div:hover p {
display: block;
}
```
